@HostAddress = http://localhost:5008

### 1. Create a Product
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wireless Ergonomic Mouse",
  "sku": "MOU-ERG-01",
  "description": "2.4GHz rechargeable wireless mouse",
  "unitPrice": 49.99,
  "initialQuantity": 20,
  "lowStockThreshold": 5
}

### 2. List Products (Paged & Search)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get Product by ID
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### 4. Adjust Stock In (Receive Inventory)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/products/1/stock-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 10,
  "note": "Warehouse shipment arrival"
}

### 5. Adjust Stock Out (Dispatch Inventory)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/products/1/stock-out
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 3,
  "note": "Customer order fulfillment"
}

### 6. View Product Movement Audit History
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products/1/movements?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### 7. Low Stock Alerts
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/inventory/low-stock
Accept: application/json

### 8. Inventory Summary & Valuation
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/inventory/summary
Accept: application/json
